{title: Patthar Ke Sanam}
{artist: Mohammed Rafi}
{key: A}

{c: Verse 1}
[A] Patthar ke sanam [E] tujhe hamne,        [E] Mohabbat ka [A] khuda jaana
[A] Badhi bhool hui arey [E] hamne,        [E] Yeh kya samjha yeh [A] kya jaana
[A] Patthar ke sanam...        [A] Chehera tera dil [D] mein liye
[D] Chalte rahe [E] angaaron [A] pe,        [A] Tu ho kahin...
[A] Tu ho kahin [D] sajde kiye,        [D] Hamne tere [E] rukhsaron [A] ke
[D] Humsa na hooo... koi [A] diwa [E] na,        [A] Patthar ke sanam...
[A] Socha tha yeh [D] badh jayengi,        [D] Tanhaiyaan jab [E] raaton [A] ki
[A] Rasta Hamein....        [A] Rasta hamein dikh [D] layengi
[D] Sham-e-wafa un [E] haathon [A] ki,        [D] Thokar lagi... tab [A] pehcha [E] ana
[A] Patthar ke sanam...        [A] Aaey kaash ke [D] hoti khabar
[D] Toone kise [E] thukraya [A] hai,        [A] Shisha nahi...
[A] Shisha nahi [D] sagar nahi,        [D] Mandir sa ik dil [E] dhaya [A] hai
[D] Dha aasmaan hain [A] vira [E] na,        [A] Patthar ke sanam...
